### Create a new Todo

POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Study REST API",
    "description": "Learn Node.js and Express",
    "state": "todo"
}

### Get all todos

GET http://localhost:3000/todos

### Get a single todo by ID

GET http://localhost:3000/todos/fca2a927-3675-46c1-a48c-ab3373aed2dc

### Update a todo

PATCH http://localhost:3000/todos/50844fbc-5971-49d8-aaa7-90813dd82419
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "state": "doing"
}

### Delete a todo

DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/d97cfa86-4b53-4c77-b1b0-1516fcf961f6

### Test missing title

POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Learn REST API"
}

### Test invalid state

POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Study REST API",
    "state": "finished"
}

### Test PATCH invalid state

PATCH http://localhost:3000/todos/9f69f224-26be-4706-ba4f-f53594cf5347
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "state": "finished"
}